    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "THE GAP",
      "narration": "Premium operators face a forced choice. The deepest formats \u2014 psychedelic ceremonies, clinical therapy \u2014 carry legal and reputational risk. The easy formats \u2014 generic sound baths, meditation apps \u2014 lack depth. Beacon + PMP sits in the gap: substance-free, hostable, commercially legible.",
