    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "THE CATEGORY",
      "narration": "We are building a new category. Proprietary technology \u2014 a uniquely organized acoustic environment. Careful protocol \u2014 situated listening, non-obligatory participation, safe entry and exit. Symbolic guidance \u2014 narrative framing without clinical intervention. Not therapy. Not a medical device. Not an app. A live, signature wellness journey.",
