    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "THE SIGNAL",
      "narration": "Began as an experimental probe for Harmonic Information Theory \u2014 to make harmonic structure perceptible in embodied listening. Nearly a year of free exploratory implementations: Tai Chi groups, elder day care, remote sessions, Edge City 2025. At Edge City, people returned, queued, and reported positive subjective effects. These are experiential accounts, not clinical evidence. The pull from real use justified testing Beacon as a disciplined wellness format.",
      "duration_target": 32.74,
      "anchor_slide": 6,
      "display_phrase": "THE PULL",
      "display_time_in": 11.46,
