    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "THE WEDGE",
      "narration": "Two point nine two million tourists, five point four billion in tourism income, nine to ten percent wellness market growth. Costa Rica is not proof of product-market fit. It is the precise buyer context to test it. Our commercial wedge: a B2B2C founder pop-up, USD 95 per attendee, USD 850 minimum, 75 to 90 minutes. Our lane guard: strict non-clinical discipline. We separate Beacon, PMP, the app, and AI. Each no protects the value of the yes.",
