      "id": 7,
      "title": "THE TEAM + ASK",
      "narration": "A multidisciplinary team combining harmonic R&D, psychological lineage, and software engineering. The team is in Costa Rica right now, executing this pilot phase. We are pre-pilot, seeking operational access. Qualified introductions to boutique wellness operators and retreat hosts. A local champion who can open, qualify, and filter these conversations. Capital is a next-stage conversation, strictly conditional on validating the format through these first paid pilots.",
